beam_gev: // number | null
.number,
// Vcut
//
// Vcut
vcut: // number | null
.number,
// Work Dir
//
// Work Dir
work_dir: // string | null
.default: null,
}) => any;

So we can call that as well. Let's first call preflight_check to see if the points are physically allowed. Use same points as defined. Provide channel "eta", points array. Provide beam_gev 6.53 maybe; vcut maybe null; work_dir maybe null.

Will get a report per-point PASS/WARN/FAIL. That will help us decide if any warnings. Let's do that.

